{"id":"7f96c502a4a99a46","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md","title":"Measurable Space","display":"df-measurable-space — Measurable Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-measurable-space","aliases":["58-df-measurable-space","Measurable Space","58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-space","58-df-zfc-measure5-measurable-space","58-df-zfc-measure6-measurable-space"],"display":"df-measurable-space — Measurable Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-measurable-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-measurable-space</span><span>Measurable Space</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-measurable-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-measurable-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-measurable-space — Measurable Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure6} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure6} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Measurable space: set + <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra; defines measurability without measure</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-space</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-measure5-measurable-space</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-measure6-measurable-space</code> are merged here.</li>\n<li>Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra: generated by open sets; standard for analysis</li>\n<li>Polish spaces: separable complete metric; all uncountable Borel sets have same cardinality</li>\n<li>Analytic subsets of Polish spaces are universally measurable in ZFC, although they need not be Borel.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cohn, Measure Theory</li>\n<li>Dudley, Real Analysis and Probability</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)$ (see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure5} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure6} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1935,"backlinks":[{"id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_+$ 是 $[0,\\infty]$ 上的 Borel $\\sigma$-代数，且 $\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)$（see [[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]]）"},{"id":"cf669143a6c6007e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A)$ and $\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb R)$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])"},{"id":"49ad0501f11b0cd1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasurableSpace}_S$ (measurable-space predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-measurable-space.md]])"},{"id":"56239458358186f6","anchor":"ref-2","lo